# ParallaxPay on NEAR. Copy to .env.local and fill in what you need; never commit real values.
# Nothing here is required to read markets: without keys the app and the agent run, and the agent
# simply never trades.

# --- The agent (npm run engine:near) ---------------------------------------
# The agent account's function-call key (`tsx scripts/near/setup.ts agent`). It can only call
# trade, seal, reveal and recover on the vault. Without it the agent reads markets and never trades.
NEAR_AGENT_KEY=
# NEAR AI Cloud: the analyst's second opinion (an open model in a TEE, answers signed), the Ask
# answers and teaching a strategy in words. Without it the agent never buys: no second opinion, no trade.
NEAR_AI_API_KEY=
# NEAR_AI_MODEL=z-ai/glm-5.3-flash
# NEAR_AI_BASE_URL=https://cloud-api.near.ai/v1
# Slippage allowed on Rhea, in basis points.
# NEAR_SLIPPAGE_BPS=80
# Ask answers per day, across everyone.
# ASK_MAX_PER_DAY=300

# --- NEAR --------------------------------------------------------------------
# An RPC to try first; public ones follow.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_NEAR_RPC=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_NEAR_VAULT=vault.parallaxpay.near
# NEXT_PUBLIC_NEAR_AGENT=agent.parallaxpay.near
# NEAR Intents 1-Click, for funds from other chains: an optional API token.
# ONECLICK_JWT=
# ONECLICK_BASE_URL=https://1click.chaindefuser.com

# --- Owner scripts only (scripts/near/setup.ts). Keep this key off every server. ---
# NEAR_OWNER=parallaxpay.near
# NEAR_OWNER_KEY=

# --- App -----------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CODE_URL=https://github.com/shariqazeem/parallaxpay-near
# PARALLAXPAY_DB_PATH=var/parallaxpay.db
# PARALLAXPAY_CHART_DIR=var/charts

# The Metis-era engine (engine/main.ts) and its settings are documented at the `pre-hackathon` tag.
